title: Route1KnockStart
tags: cutscene
---
<<declare $r1_knock_reached = false>>
// The entry node of box R1Knock, started by going to bed after the second dinner or the
// retry (bed_3b.yarn). Some nights later, late, he is in bed in 3B. What the box owns is
// reset here. $r1_knock_reached: he reached for her and she stopped him (only her words
// change).
<<enter_box R1Knock>>
<<set $r1_knock_reached to false>>
<<fade_out>>
<<hide Samantha>>
<<place Player PlayerToBedroom>>
<<face Player down>>
<<card "Some nights later.">>
<<fade_in>>
// Three knocks. Not loud.
{$samantha_name}: It's me.
{$samantha_name}: I know you're awake.
You: ...It's past midnight.
{$samantha_name}: Yes. Open the door.
<<done R1Knock late>>
<<note r1_knock "She's knocking. If she knocks, you answer.">>
// The player walks to the front door. Answering it starts Route1KnockOpen (door_3b_inside.yarn).
===
title: Route1KnockOpen
tags: cutscene
---
// Started by answering the door in the night (door_3b_inside.yarn). She comes in, the
// first time since the viewing.
<<place Samantha SamanthaWait>>
<<show Samantha>>
<<open_door Door3B>>
<<face Samantha Player>>
<<face Player Samantha>>
{$samantha_name}: You answered. First knock.
You: You said I had to.
{$samantha_name}: I did. I didn't think you'd be so quick about it.
{$samantha_name}: Shoes?
You: ...I'm in bed. I'm not wearing anything on my feet.
{$samantha_name}: Good. Then there's nothing to take off.
// She walks him back to the bed.
<<walk Samantha SamanthaToBedroom no_wait>>
<<walk Player PlayerToBedroom>>
<<await_walks>>
<<close_door Door3B>>
<<face Samantha Player>>
<<face Player Samantha>>
{$samantha_name}: It's too quiet next door.
{$samantha_name}: I couldn't sleep. I thought about you instead.
{$samantha_name}: Don't say anything. Don't touch.
{$samantha_name}: Wait.
<<done R1Knock open>>
<<note r1_knock "She said wait. Hold still.">>
// The player is in control: holding still or reaching for her are actions on her
// (samantha_3a.yarn). Reaching only gets "Wait." Holding still starts Route1KnockHold.
===
title: Route1KnockHold
tags: cutscene
---
// Started by holding still when she tells him to wait (samantha_3a.yarn). The night
// happens off screen; the morning follows in this scene.
<<done R1Knock wait>>
<<if $r1_knock_reached>>
    {$samantha_name}: There. Was that so hard?
<<else>>
    {$samantha_name}: Good. You listen.
<<endif>>
{$samantha_name}: Not yet. Not until I say.
// She takes her time. She sits on the edge of the bed, then closer.
{$samantha_name}: Look at me. Not at my hands.
<<wait 1>>
<<fade_out>>
// The night, on a dark screen until it has scene art. She leads: he waits, holds
// still, and doesn't touch until she says.
// Scene art, later: her on the edge of his mattress, his hands flat on the sheet.
{$samantha_name}: Hands flat on the sheet. Both of them.
You: Like this?
{$samantha_name}: Like that. If they move, I stop. Understood?
You: Understood.
// She pulls her top over her head and drops it on his floor.
{$samantha_name}: You're staring.
You: You said look at you.
{$samantha_name}: I did. Keep doing it.
// She pushes the duvet down, slowly, all the way.
{$samantha_name}: Oh. You've been waiting a while already.
You: Since you knocked.
{$samantha_name}: Then a little longer won't kill you.
// She takes him in her hand and doesn't move it.
{$samantha_name}: Breathe.
You: I am.
{$samantha_name}: Slower.
// She strokes him once, all the way, and stops.
You: Please.
{$samantha_name}: Please what?
You: ...Don't stop.
{$samantha_name}: That's not your decision. Hands.
// His hands had lifted off the sheet. He puts them back.
{$samantha_name}: Good.
// Scene art, later: her astride him, one hand on his chest.
// She climbs over him and sinks down onto him, an inch at a time, watching his face.
{$samantha_name}: Don't move your hips. I'm doing this. You're having it done to you.
You: God.
{$samantha_name}: Not God. Me.
// She rides him slowly, for herself, and he lets her.
{$samantha_name}: You want to come.
You: Yes.
{$samantha_name}: Not yet. Not until I say. I want to see if you can.
You: I can't. Not much longer.
{$samantha_name}: You can. Look at me.
// She takes her own pleasure first, her hand pressing his chest down, and he holds on.
// Her breath goes ragged. She shudders, and stills, and smiles down at him.
{$samantha_name}: There.
{$samantha_name}: Now ask.
You: Can I... please?
{$samantha_name}: Good. Now.
// He comes with his hands still flat on the sheet.
<<wait 1>>
{$samantha_name}: You didn't move them once.
You: You said not to.
{$samantha_name}: I know. I was watching.
// She lies down beside him, on top of the duvet, and doesn't touch him.
{$samantha_name}: Sleep. I'm staying.
<<wait 1>>
<<card "Morning.">>
<<place Player PlayerToBedroom>>
<<face Player down>>
<<place Samantha SamanthaToWindow>>
<<show Samantha>>
<<face Samantha down>>
<<fade_in>>
{$samantha_name}: Morning.
You: You're dressed.
{$samantha_name}: I've been up an hour. You sleep like someone with nothing on his conscience.
{$samantha_name}: I kept you waiting last night. You didn't complain once.
You: I didn't want to.
{$samantha_name}: I know.
{$samantha_name}: You're my boyfriend now. I decided.
You: Don't I get a say?
{$samantha_name}: You had one. You stood still.
{$samantha_name}: Work. Don't be late. I'll know.
// She lets herself out.
<<open_door Door3B>>
<<walk Samantha SamanthaToLanding>>
<<hide Samantha>>
<<close_door Door3B>>
<<wait 1>>
<<done R1Knock morning>>
<<note r1_knock "Go to work.">>
You: Boyfriend. She decided.
// The player is in control in 3B. Going out to work (door_3b_inside.yarn) is the exit: it
// starts R1Notebook, since free time has no scene.
===
